  "summary": "tigervnc vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that the TigerVNC viewer stored TLS certificate\nexceptions as trusted certificate authorities. A remote attacker could\npossibly use this issue to impersonate any VNC server after a user had\nadded a certificate exception for the attacker's server.",
